sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, Node: Scanning for peripherals using resolvable private addresses

    App->>Node: GapCentral.StartDeviceDiscovery()
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(scanning)
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.DeviceDiscovered(<br>addressWithType={address=6C:8B:2F:3A:9D:41, addressType=randomAddress},<br>rssi=-42)

    Note over App: Check if this RPA belongs to a known bonded device

    App->>Node: GapCentral.ResolvePrivateAddress(6C:8B:2F:3A:9D:41)

    alt Device is bonded
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.ResolvePrivateAddressResult(<br>success=true, identityAddress=C4:AB:12:34:56:78)
        Note over App: Known device, proceed with connection
    else Device is not bonded
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.ResolvePrivateAddressResult(<br>success=false)
        Note over App: Unknown device
    end
